{"id":8561916,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/4816","number":4816,"state":"merged","title":"【GroupedMatmul】修复k轴分组pertensor-perchannel场景量化模式设置错误","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/4816","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/4816/issues","body":"## 描述\n根因：x1Scale为(G,)且G=M时, k轴分组和m轴分组进入的是不同的量化模式，M轴分组为pertoken, K轴分组为pertensor, 但代码未做分组区分都统一进入了pertoken分支，导致计算错误精度失败\n解决方法：修改量化模式设置，只要是k轴分组且x1Scale为(G,)就设置为pertensor\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/issues/2252\n\n## 测试\n测试精度通过\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：\n\n","assignees_number":10,"assignees":[{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"Allan_Yu","name":"YuZhengzhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c115ac4dcd85262391d21a","login":"wenxin_fight","name":"wenxin_fight","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c1382c7f18604d4aaabbee","login":"mabing1118","name":"mabing","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/mabing1118","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822b81724adff5452d7afc2","login":"monologue815","name":"monologue815","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/monologue815","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","login":"cc-z","name":"赵臣臣","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cc-z","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6877715d70f8532fca319fe9","login":"liudan12","name":"liudan12","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liudan12","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822bdee053